{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#2_3321147942","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of the same dedicated First Quarter Finance article on Target loss prevention/shoplifting policy, with direct statements about asset protection staff, law enforcement cooperation, arrest/prosecution, fines/legal fees, and incident documentation.","learned":"Repeated evidence: Target asset protection specialists document shoplifting incidents; suspects may be arrested/prosecuted and be responsible for legal costs depending on state and severity."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1248","reason":"The focused query is yielding direct evidence; continue briefly to find additional non-duplicate results or further policy details."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1248"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#0_3321144158","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1248","rank":3,"snippet":"Finance Target Loss Prevention Policy: Fines, Legal Penalties, etc https://firstquarterfinance.com/target-loss-prevention-policy/ Cathy Desmet | Published Aug 26, 2019 Short Answer: Target’s asset protection and security specialists are responsible for theft prevention and recovery of Target merchandise and equipment. The team designs their processes to ensure the safety of employees and customers. Target stores also use security cameras and work closely with the local police in an effort to prevent shoplifting. For more information on the Target loss prevention policy, see below. Table of Contents Target Loss Prevention Policy General Target Loss Prevention Policy Suspect Apprehension Legal Penalties: Target Shoplifting Fines and More Other Store <cover>Shoplifting Policies Target Loss Prevention Policy</cover>Target’s loss prevention policy includes the use of video surveillance systems to help control theft and assist in the recovery of stolen merchandise, a corporate customer service associate said. This applies both inside and outside the store on Target property.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"Target Loss Prevention Policy: Fines, Legal Penalties, etc - First Quarter Finance\" , \"url\": \"https://firstquarterfinance.com/target-loss-prevention-policy/\" }"}}
