{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#3_3321149932","relevance":3,"reason":"This segment is from a dedicated Target loss prevention/shoplifting policy article and gives direct policy details: fines vary by state/severity, asset protection documents incidents and trends, security specialists assist with suspect apprehension, recover merchandise, and document security issues.","learned":"Target asset protection/security specialists reportedly document shoplifting incidents and trends, assist with suspect apprehension, recover merchandise, and handle security issues."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1249","reason":"This query is focused on Target asset protection and apprehension; continue to look for additional direct evidence or non-duplicate sources."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1249"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2016099027#5_3306910580","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1249","rank":5,"snippet":": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2016099027#5_3306910580\" , \"end_char\": 4224.000000 , \"headings\": \"CVS Shoplifting Policy Explained in Detail: Know What Would Happen CVS Shoplifting Policy Explained in Detail: Know What Would Happen Table of Contents The CVS Shoplifting Policy Asset Protection Staff Anti-Theft Devices and Monitoring Suspect <cover>Apprehension Arrest and Prosecution More Information \" , \"segment\": \"They can, however, follow and/or approach suspects inside the store. The store manager has the final say on how to proceed with a shoplifting suspect. Arrest and Prosecution If you are caught stealing from CVS and the store manager decides to contact local law enforcement, officials will follow state guidelines regarding theft. Our article on asset protection at Target </cover>has more information about theft laws, fines, and jail time. Potential charges include misdemeanor or felony larceny (depending on the value of the stolen merchandise) and possession of stolen property. You can also be ordered to not visit the store again. More Information For more information on shoplifting policies, see our articles detailing the shoplifting policy at Lowe’s and The Home Depot’s ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#0_3321144158","rank":2,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#2_3321147942","rank":3,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#1_3321145933","rank":4,"relevance":3}]}}
