{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ target \"loss prevention\" shoplifters)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_52_641592274#15_1226304828","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1275","rank":5,"snippet":"Loss Prevention Plan for Your Store How to Put Together a Loss Prevention Plan for Your Store The Basics of a Loss Prevention Plan Creating a Plan to Reduce Shrinkage Step 1: Size Up the Problem Step 2: Secure Buy-In Step 3: Audit Hiring and Training Practices Optional: Hire a Loss Prevention Manager Tactics to Prevent Shoplifting and Theft Successful Loss Prevention Plans Sears Canada: Video Analysis Enables Proactive Prevention<cover>Target: Loss Prevention at Self-Checkout Meijer: Using Technology to Find Exceptions Get More Out of Your Inventory With a Loss Prevention Plan About the author Kiera Abbamonte Topics: Start your 14-day free trial today! \" , \"segment\": \"Deliberate store organization: Aisles overflowing with disorganized merchandise are like a playground for shoplifters. </cover>They make it easy to grab any number of items without leaving a trace. After all, how can employees tell something’s missing when products don’t have a designated place where they should be? Keep your store well organized, and have employees restock and tidy up shelves regularly throughout the day. Top-notch customer service: It’s good business sense to focus on great customer service – but it can also help ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#1_3321145933","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#2_3321147942","rank":2,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_19_2021688056#3_3321149932","rank":3,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_52_641592274#18_1226310861","rank":4,"relevance":2}]}}
